# Heater cooker meat→steak conversion (one operation = one ItemCook broadcast).
# Provenance: backlog item-domain TODO "Heater cooker meat→steak conversion";
# the host's full-physics scene runs Heater.OnCollisionEnter2D and reports the
# conversion through ItemCook (NetMsg 92). The host's world table flips
# source→cooked atomically and both guests receive exactly one wire frame.
@0 cook host 42 43 steak 0.24
@33 expect received g1 ItemCook 1
@33 expect received g2 ItemCook 1
@66 expect no_host_table 42
@66 expect host_table 43
